{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-e15090b710d88cd2d66a6e75a82ee5d4fa1ab731f731337b","family_id":"KR:013220","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"ENFORCEMENT DECREE OF THE ACT ON MANAGEMENT OF FIREFIGHTING EQUIPMENT","title_original":"소방장비관리법 시행령","kind":"대통령령","source_version":"287377","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=287377","source_sha256":"5ec8ed6d9986beb9b06e27df3fdfd117ffbb23733f907e5568d570449f38d7fc","body_sha256":"bd35ab8642d0bba217b5c263062d9446bcfc22f8029e7cda05ecc980bce94efd","article_count":0,"full_text":"■ Enforcement Decree of the Act on Management of Firefighting Equipment [Attached Table 3]\n\nCriteria for Imposition of Penalty Surcharges (Re: Article 23 (1))\n\n1. General criteria\n\n(a) One month of suspension of services shall be calculated as 30 days.\n\n(b) The penalty surcharge shall be the amount obtained by multiplying the suspension period imposed under the standards for suspension of services under Article 14 (6) of the Act by the penalty surcharge corresponding to one day of suspension under the individual criteria in paragraph 2.\n\n(c) When imposing a penalty surcharge, the Fire Commissioner of the National Fire Agency may increase or reduce the amount under item (b) by up to one half in consideration of the motive, substance, degree and number of violations, etc. Even where the amount is increased, the total penalty surcharge shall not exceed 300 million won.\n\n2. Individual criteria\n\n| Violation | Legal basis | Penalty surcharge corresponding to one day of suspension of services |\n|---|---|---|\n| (a) Failing to perform certification services for a continuous period of one year or longer without good cause | Article 14 (6) 2 of the Act | 500,000 won |\n| (b) Ceasing to meet the requirements for designation as a certification institution under Article 14 (1) of the Act | Article 14 (6) 3 of the Act | 1,000,000 won |\n| (c) Being deemed to have lost public confidence in certification due to errors, omissions, etc. | Article 14 (6) 4 of the Act | 1,000,000 won |\n| (d) Refusing an application for certification of fire equipment without good cause | Article 14 (6) 5 of the Act | 1,000,000 won |\n| (e) Engaging in improper conduct in relation to certification | Article 14 (6) 6 of the Act | 1,500,000 won |","metadata":{"author_checks":["All current held source unit text, source editorial notes, amounts, periods, exceptions and source omission boundaries compared.","Unchanged official English retained only in the recorded exact source/target spans; original row, role, provider, edition, links and receipts remain unchanged.","New affected units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION / UNREVIEWED; source graphics remain linked to actual unchanged assets.","Source unit keys, order and full-text SHA matched the frozen inventory."],"author_method":"Direct assistant translation of exact held Korean source; complete explicit source units with source-order and UTF-8 SHA checks.","author_self_check_record":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\translations\\decree\\en.units.parts\\annex-000300E.selfcheck.json","sha256":"e23c6d3806264660baeaee38731e6958f12c366d49fd4426afd291cca9710ecb"},"body_and_addenda_complete":false,"component_id":"DECREE:kr-013220-287377-ko","component_ids":["DECREE:kr-013220-287377-ko:annex-000300E"],"component_kind":"DECREE","edition_id":"edition-5ab2a19b19eb0df0623363b4150efed54ea5b269bce5b268","english_gap_scope_plan":{"path":"\\\\100.90.87.105\\YOLLA-D\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1521_KR013050\\direct_ingest_v1\\english_gap_scope_plan_v1.json","reason":{"changes":[],"reason":"No English annex content exists in the held English XML or DB full text; this entir